#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""flr-engine-update: server-side engine auto-updater with a compatibility lock.

Updates the Hysteria2 server binary to the latest compatible stable release,
remembers the last known good version, and blocks proven compatibility
regressions. Also reports (read-only) whether the
AmneziaWG DKMS module exists for the kernel the server will boot next.

Python 3.11+, standard library only. It never runs apt/dpkg, never reboots and
never touches the firewall. See README.md for lock semantics and exit codes.
"""
